## Secrets — the real .env NEVER enters the repository, only .env.example does.
## The .env.* line matters for the frontend: Vite reads .env.development / .env.production
## / .env.local, and none of those match the `.env` or `*.env` patterns above.
.env
.env.local
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example

